- Reload role guidance: \`CHATROOM_CONVEX_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3210 chatroom get-role-guidance --chatroom-id="characterisation-chatroom" --role="product-manager"\`

**History retrieval:** Run \`CHATROOM_CONVEX_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3210 chatroom messages download --chatroom-id="characterisation-chatroom" --role="product-manager" --since-message-id="<from-anchor>" --limit=100\` for searchable history (required for cross-task summaries). Use the absolute path printed by the CLI."
`;

