Fill in the message using the \`<handoff-templates>\` block headed "### Handoff template \`triage\` → \`<recipient>\`" for the recipient you hand off to. Replace \`[Your message here]\` with that template's body. The closing line must be exactly \`CHATROOM_HANDOFF_END\` (not \`EOF\`).

